}
```
Progress answered count from answers with selected/text or any row. But Answer rows may include auto-created unanswered at grading only. Before submit count rows with (selectedOptions not empty or textAnswer). Do in service.

`ResultadoPreguntaDto` {posicion, preguntaId, enunciado, tipo, puntos, puntosObtenidos, correcta, respondida, seleccion: {id,texto}[], textoRespuesta, correctas: {id,texto}[], explicacion}
`ResultadoIntentoDto` {id, quizId, tituloQuiz, estado, motivo, enviadoEn, mostrar, puntaje, puntajeMaximo, nota, aprobada, preguntas?}
For NONE hide all score fields (set null) and preguntas [].

`ResumenIntentoDto` {preguntas: {posicion, enunciado, respondida}[]; respondidas; total}.

Client type additions.

Now service code. Need include type:

```
