} as const;
```
Attempt row has quiz; quiz.questions includes question + points.

`type Intento = NonNullable<Awaited<ReturnType<typeof buscarIntento>>>`.

`buscarIntento(id)`.

Functions:
- `obtenerIntentoAutorizado(id, studentId)`.
- `leerLista`, `leerMapa`.
- `entradasDelIntento(intento)`.
- `entradaActual`.
- `opcionesEnOrden(intento, entrada)`.
- `segundosEntre`.
