Now service. Write carefully.

Also include functions for start building orders and eligibility? Put `crearIntento` in service too.

`INCLUDE_INTENTO` export for pages.

Pseudo:

```ts
import { prisma } from '@/lib/db';
import { ErrorApi, conflicto, noEncontrado, sinPermiso } from '@/lib/http';
import { auditar, ACCIONES } from '@/lib/audit';
import type {...} from '@/lib/cliente/tipos';
import type { Quiz } from '@prisma/client'? use inferred.

export const INCLUDE_INTENTO = {
 quiz: {
   include: {
     questions: { orderBy: {position:'asc'}, include: { question: { include: { options: { orderBy: {position:'asc'} } } } } },
   },
 },
 answers: true,
} as const;

async function buscarIntento(id) { return prisma.attempt.findUnique({where:{id}, include: INCLUDE_INTENTO}); }
export type IntentoCompleto = NonNullable<Awaited<ReturnType<typeof buscarIntento>>>;
```

`entradasDelIntento` returns objects from quiz.questions filtered order:
```
type Entrada = IntentoCompleto['quiz']['questions'][number];
```
`obtenerEntradas`:
```
const orden = leerLista(intento.questionOrder);
const mapa = new Map(intento.quiz.questions.map(q=>[q.questionId,q]));
return orden.map(id=>mapa.get(id)).filter((x): x is Entrada => Boolean(x));
```

`preguntaActual` returns entries[pos].

`opcionesVisibles`:
```
const mapa = leerMapa(intento.optionOrder);
const orden = mapa[entrada.questionId];
const opciones = entrada.question.options.slice().sort(...);
if (orden?.length) { sort by index in orden; }
return opciones.map((o,i)=>({...o, etiqueta: String.fromCharCode(65+i)}))
```
For stored option IDs, if question options changed after start, filter missing.

`respuestaActual`: answer row for question id; parse selected IDs; text.

`respuestaTieneContenido`.

`estadoIntentoDto`:
```
const entradas = ...
const total=...
const pos=Math.min(intento.currentPosition,total-1)
const entrada=entradas[pos]
const ahora=new Date()
const respuesta=...
const opciones = entrada ? opcionesVisibles : []
const esCorta = entrada.question.type==='SHORT_ANSWER'
return {
 ...
 pregunta: entrada ? {... opciones: esCorta?[]: opciones.map(...), ayuda, respuesta:{opciones: respuesta.seleccion, texto: respuesta.texto??''}} : null,
 expiraEn: intento.expiresAt?.toISOString() ?? null,
 preguntaExpiraEn: ...,
 ahora: ahora.toISOString(),
 segundosRestantes: segundosHasta(intento.expiresAt, ahora),
 segundosPreguntaRestantes: ...,
 respondidas: entradas.filter(e => respuestaConContenido(...)).length
}
```
`preguntaExpiraEn` only if perQuestionTime and status in progress.

`segundosHasta`: if fecha null return null; Math.max(0, Math.ceil((fecha-ahora)/1000)).

`resultadoIntentoDto` with showResults.

Grading helper:
```
function normalizarTexto(valor) { ... }
function esRespuestaCorrecta(entrada, seleccion, texto) {...}
```
For SHORT_ANSWER, correcta if normalized text matches any correct option text (maybe allow multiple accepted answers). If no text → false.
For others compare sets.

`calificarYEnviar(intento, motivo)`:
```
if (intento.status === 'SUBMITTED') return intento;
if (intento.status === 'VOIDED') throw conflicto('El intento fue anulado...');
const entradas = obtenerEntradas(intento);
const respuestas = new Map(intento.answers.map(...));
let score=0, maxScore=0;
const calculos = entradas.map(...)
for each: correcta, puntos
await prisma.$transaction(async tx => {
  for calc: await tx.answer.upsert({where:{attemptId_questionId:{attemptId,questionId}}, update:{...}, create:{...}})
  await tx.attempt.update({data:{status:'SUBMITTED', submittedAt: now, submitReason: motivo, lastSeenAt: now, score, maxScore, grade, passed}})
})
const actualizado=await buscarIntento(intento.id); if (!actualizado) throw noEncontrado('Intento');
await auditar(...)
return actualizado;
```
`attemptId_questionId` unique constraint name? Prisma composite key field name likely `attemptId_questionId`. Could avoid upsert and manually find existing from intento.answers:
```
const existente = respuestas.get(entry.questionId)
if existente -> tx.answer.update({where:{id: existente.id},...})
else tx.answer.create(...)
```
Safer.

`grade`: `maxScore > 0 ? Math.round((score/maxScore*quiz.maxGrade + Number.EPSILON)*100)/100 : 0`; passed = grade >= passingScore.

`motivo` typed string but schema has values.

`procesarTiempos` as above. Note calificar uses `intento` with include; if attempt updated by other request first, transaction may double-submit? Update has no status guard. Two concurrent submit calls both grade; upserts safe, final same. Fine. For idempotence, check status at start; race rare.

`iniciarIntento(quiz, studentId, ip, userAgent)` needs quiz include questions. Route loads quiz with `questions include question.options`. Type separate:
```
type QuizParaIntento = NonNullable<Awaited<ReturnType<typeof buscarQuizParaIntento>>>;
```
In service:
```
async function buscarQuiz(id) { return prisma.quiz.findUnique({ where:{id}, include:{ questions:{orderBy:{position:'asc'}, include:{question:{include:{options:{orderBy:{position:'asc'}}}}}} } }); }
```
